OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed for claiming on
OL,4,AFacebook her ex-husband was a 'rapist'
OL,5,Aand 'baby killer'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman has been jailed for posting a
OL,8,Fstring of lies on social media about
OL,9,Fher police officer ex-husband, claiming
OL,10,Fhe was a "rapist" and a "baby killer".
OL,12,FJennifer Pritchard, 47, from Tredegar
OL,13,Fin Blaenau Gwent, created a Facebook
OL,14,Fpage called "Jen's Justice" where she
OL,15,Fled a two-month smear campaign against
OL,16,FStephen Pritchard, a South Wales Police
OL,17,Fofficer.
OL,19,FSgt Pritchard, who said he had been
OL,20,Finvestigated by his force over the
OL,21,Ffalse allegations, said he wanted his
OL,22,F"life back".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
