OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed for claiming on
OL,4,AFacebook her ex-husband was a 'rapist'
OL,5,Aand 'baby killer'
OL,6,
OL,7,FJennifer Pritchard, who had pleaded
OL,8,Fguilty on the day of her trial to a
OL,9,Fmalicious communication offence, was
OL,10,Fsentenced on Friday at Cardiff Crown
OL,11,FCourt to 18 months in prison.
